  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@storybook/addon-actions](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.3` -> `5.1.8`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2faddon-actions/5.1.3/5.1.8) |\n| [@storybook/html](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.3` -> `5.1.8`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2fhtml/5.1.3/5.1.8) |\n| [@storybook/theming](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.3` -> `5.1.8`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2ftheming/5.1.3/5.1.8) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>storybookjs/storybook</summary>\n\n### [`v5.1.8`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/v5.1.8)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.7...v5.1.8)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   CLI: Fix RN template to not import addons ([#&#8203;7096](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7096))\n\n### [`v5.1.7`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/v5.1.7)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.6...v5.1.7)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   UI: Fix warning of loading prop not being a string ([#&#8203;7080](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7080))\n\n### [`v5.1.6`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.5...v5.1.6)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.5...v5.1.6)\n\n### [`v5.1.5`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/v5.1.5)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.4...v5.1.5)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Core: Upgrade plugin core-js fix ([#&#8203;7086](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7086))\n-   UI: Fix sidebar loading visibility ([#&#8203;7073](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7073))\n-   UI: Fix unnecessarily large bundlesize ([#&#8203;7091](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7091))\n-   Addon-contexts, RN-server: Add core-js dep ([#&#8203;7094](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7094))\n\n### [`v5.1.4`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/releases/v5.1.4)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.3...v5.1.4)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Core: Fix core-js 3 errors ([#&#8203;7051](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7051))\n-   UI: Fix syntax highlighter plain text not visible ([#&#8203;7057](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7057))\n-   Addon-actions: Add default options to action(s) ([#&#8203;6438](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/6438))\n\n##### Dependency Upgrades\n\n-   RN: add missing core-js dependency ([#&#8203;7016](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7016))\n-   chore: set react version to 16.8.3 to match react native ([#&#8203;7008](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7008))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
